OL,3,AMan charged with murder after house
OL,4,Afire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged with murder,
OL,7,Fattempted murder and arson following a
OL,8,Ffire in west London that left a woman
OL,9,Fdead and eight others in need of
OL,10,Fhospital treatment.
OL,12,FPawel Kulpa, 34, faces one count of
OL,13,Fmurder, eight counts of attempted
OL,14,Fmurder and one count of arson with
OL,15,Fintent to endanger life.
OL,17,FThe charges come after a fire at a
OL,18,Fresidential address on Berkeley Avenue,
OL,19,FHounslow, at about 01:15 BST on
OL,20,FWednesday, 19 August.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
